<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>tudu is a demo of Kiosk. This page says what it stores and for how long.</p>
<h2>What tudu stores</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Your account.</strong> Your e-mail address, a hash of your password, your display name and when you
    signed up.</li>
  <li><strong>Your lists.</strong> Each list's title and members, and each to-do's title, due time, whether it is done
    and which assistant added it. Every member of a list can read it.</li>
  <li><strong>Invites.</strong> A hash of each invite code, who made it, when it expires and who used it.</li>
</ul>
<%= render 'privacy/kiosk' %>
<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
<p>We keep everything above that names no other time until we reset this demo. We reset it by hand, with no
  fixed schedule, and a reset deletes every account and every row named on this page.</p>
